  4. BUILDING NEARESTNEIGHBORS MODEL
======================================================================
   Configuration:
     metric       : cosine
     algorithm    : brute
     n_neighbors  : 11

   NearestNeighbors fitted successfully.
   Fit time : 0.00s

   Design note:
     algorithm='brute'  computes distances on-the-fly at query time.
     No N x N similarity matrix is ever computed or held in memory.
     Memory peak = O(N * F) for the sparse matrix, NOT O(N^2).
     A full dense cosine matrix would require ~15.20 GB.
     The sparse approach uses only 15.64 MB.

